      "minDuration": 11,
      "slide": {
        "title": "Use Punctuation to Shape the Pace",
        "text": "Full stop: a short pause. Comma: a smaller pause. 'There was one exception. Low-light images.'",
        "notes": "Narration takes its cues from punctuation. Put an important phrase in its own short sentence, and the listener gets time to absorb each point.",
